#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code execution {#code-execution}"
msgstr "Uruchamianie kodu {#code-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Run** on any code block. The first click starts a Jupyter kernel via [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). After that, runs are instant.\n"
msgstr "Kliknij **Run** na dowolnym bloku kodu. Pierwsze kliknięcie uruchamia kernel Jupyter przez [Binder](https://mybinder.org) lub [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). Potem uruchomienia są natychmiastowe.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Simulator Mode (no account needed)** — Enable [Simulator Mode](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode) to run all notebooks with AerSimulator or noise-model FakeBackends. Zero setup required.\n"
msgstr "**Tryb Symulatora (bez konta)** — Włącz [Tryb Symulatora](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode), żeby uruchamiać wszystkie notebooki z AerSimulator lub FakeBackends z modelem szumu. Zero konfiguracji.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Enter your API token and CRN in [Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) once — credentials are auto-injected on every run. [Create a free account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) if you don't have one.\n"
msgstr "**Sprzęt IBM Quantum** — Wpisz swój token API i CRN w [Ustawieniach](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) raz — poświadczenia są automatycznie wstrzykiwane przy każdym uruchomieniu. [Utwórz darmowe konto](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration), jeśli jeszcze go nie masz.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available execution backends</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Dostępne backendy uruchomieniowe</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every tutorial has executable code blocks. Click **Run** to execute them using one of four backends:\n"
msgstr "Każdy tutorial ma wykonywalne bloki kodu. Kliknij **Run**, żeby uruchomić je na jednym z czterech backendów:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Binder** (default on GitHub Pages) — Free remote Jupyter kernel via [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"
msgstr "**Binder** (domyślny na GitHub Pages) — Darmowy zdalny kernel Jupyter przez [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter on your IBM Cloud account. Cold start in seconds instead of minutes. [Set up](/jupyter-settings#code-engine)\n"
msgstr "**IBM Code Engine** — Bezserwerowy Jupyter na twoim koncie IBM Cloud. Cold start w sekundy zamiast minut. [Skonfiguruj](/jupyter-settings#code-engine)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Connects to the local Jupyter server with Qiskit pre-installed\n"
msgstr "**Lokalny Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Łączy się z lokalnym serwerem Jupyter z preinstalowanym Qiskit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Custom server** — Point to any Jupyter endpoint in [Settings](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"
msgstr "**Własny serwer** — Wskaż dowolny endpoint Jupyter w [Ustawieniach](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When multiple backends are available, choose which one to use from [Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"
msgstr "Gdy dostępnych jest kilka backendów, wybierz który używać w [Ustawieniach](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr "</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Deployment options</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Opcje wdrożenia</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation is available as:\n"
msgstr "doQumentation jest dostępny jako:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site with [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine) for remote code execution\n"
msgstr "**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Statyczna strona z [Binder](https://mybinder.org) lub [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine) do zdalnego uruchamiania kodu\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)** — Full stack locally, offline capable\n"
msgstr "**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)** — Pełny stack lokalnie, możliwość pracy offline\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted on Raspberry Pi with local Jupyter kernel\n"
msgstr "**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Samodzielny hosting na Raspberry Pi z lokalnym kernelem Jupyter\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Run locally with Podman / Docker</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Uruchom lokalnie z Podman / Docker</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) or [Docker Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / Linux), then run:\n"
msgstr "Zainstaluj [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) lub [Docker Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / Linux), a następnie uruchom:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — code execution works locally, no Binder wait time.\n"
msgstr "Otwórz [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — uruchamianie kodu działa lokalnie, bez czekania na Binder.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a lightweight version without local code execution (~60 MB):\n"
msgstr "Dla lekkiej wersji bez lokalnego uruchamiania kodu (~60 MB):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using Docker instead? Just replace `podman` with `docker` — the commands are identical. Images are multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), so Apple Silicon Macs work natively.\n"
msgstr "Używasz Dockera? Po prostu zamień `podman` na `docker` — komendy są identyczne. Obrazy są wieloarchitekturowe (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), więc Apple Silicon Mac działa natywnie.\n"
